## Noncompete

Any purpose is a permitted purpose, except for providing to others any product that competes with the software.

## Competition

A product competes with the software if it offers one or more of the same or similar core functionalities as the software, and is marketed or sold to someone other than you or your affiliates, even if it provides its functionality via any kind of interface, even if it is ported to a different platform or programming language, and even if it is provided free of charge.

